Your key responsibilities will include:

• Configure, deploy, and maintain MES modules to support production, quality, logistics, and traceability processes;

• Develop and optimize SQL queries, stored procedures, and database scripts for MES data analysis and reporting;

• Integrate MES with PLCs, SCADA systems, ERP (e.g., SAP), and other factory IT systems;

• Analyze and troubleshoot MES system issues to minimize downtime and ensure data accuracy;

• Collaborate with cross-functional teams (IT, Production, Process, Quality, Maintenance);

