• Fluency in English and Chinese (Mandarin) – due to daily collaboration with Chinese engineering and IT teams;

• Familiarity with manufacturing processes in the battery, electronics, or automotive industry;

• Understanding of PLC/SCADA systems and industrial communication protocols (OPC, Modbus, etc.);

• Strong analytical and problem-solving skills with attention to detail;

• Ability to work in a multicultural, fast-paced manufacturing environment.

