Do you have a qualification in power electrical engineering and at least one year of professional experience? Join the production team at CATL Debrecen!

As a Production Technician, you will be involved in the assembly, inspection, and testing of electric vehicle battery packs. You will work with state-of-the-art manufacturing and testing technologies, applying your electrical engineering expertise in one of the key areas of electric mobility.

What tasks await you?

• Assembling, disassembling, inspecting, and testing electric vehicle battery packs in accordance with work instructions;

• Installing and inspecting electrical connectors, wiring, battery system components, and high-voltage (HV) components;

